# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Windows batch and script files MUST have CRLF line endings
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# [W2] core50 评测数据集：references/manifest.json 与 snapshots index.json 用
# sha256 逐字节锁定 fixture 与快照，换行符转换会让 Windows 检出后
# `validate --require-snapshots` 因 hash 不匹配而失败（上游 KaoyanBench 全仓
# 即 `* -text`，理由同此）。故本子树禁用一切换行符转换：入库即 LF，检出亦 LF。
tests/benchmarks/core50/** -text
